# UI

- Dark neon, condensed display (Barlow Condensed), huge media, sparse chrome
- Tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` — no random hex sprawl
- Sharp radii (2–12px); avoid soft SaaS pills
- Glass only for nav/overlays when hierarchy needs it
- **Hero budget:** brand + one headline + one support line + CTA group + one full-bleed media plane
- No hero card grids, stat strips, floating promo chips, or badge soup
- Avoid purple-on-white AI look, cream/terracotta cliché, emoji decoration
- Mobile-first; one composition per first viewport
